## 13. Stop condition

Stop and request synchronization/ruling if:

* a new theoretical claim is required;
* an OQ must change status;
* an evidence class must be upgraded;
* a governance contradiction must be resolved;
* 𝒪_core must be authoritatively frozen;
* a formal construct must be changed rather than merely documented;
* existing accepted Part II wording would need historical alteration;
* the distinction between formal, computational, empirical and governance closure becomes ambiguous.
